---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Portfolio"
  description="Operational case studies from Adrian Lee's work building and governing communities across gaming, fintech, and consumer platforms at global scale."
>
  <div class="portfolio-page" style="padding-top: var(--nav-h);">
    <div class="page-header">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-label"><span class="label">Portfolio</span></div>
        <h1 class="page-header__title">
          Work that<br>
          <em>delivered measurable results.</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="page-header__desc">
          Selected operational case studies from leading community, ecosystem, and platform governance initiatives. 
          Details are shared with permission; full operational reviews are available on request.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="cases section" aria-labelledby="cases-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="sr-only" id="cases-heading">Case studies</h2>

        <!-- Case 1 -->
        <article class="case" aria-labelledby="case-crypto-heading">
          <div class="case__header">
            <div>
              <div class="case__orgs">
                <span class="badge badge--ai">Crypto Exchange</span>
                <span class="badge badge--community">Community Strategy</span>
              </div>
              <h2 id="case-crypto-heading">
                Rebuilding community trust after a major platform incident
              </h2>
            </div>
            <div class="case__meta">
              <span class="read-time">Global scale &middot; 2M+ users</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="case__body">
            <div class="case__col">
              <div class="case__block">
                <span class="label">The challenge</span>
                <p>A global crypto exchange faced severe community trust erosion following a high-profile platform security incident. Negative sentiment spiked, moderator turnover increased rapidly, and public discussion channels were overrun with panic and unverified rumors.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="case__block">
                <span class="label">The approach</span>
                <p>Implemented a phased community stabilization framework: established a predictable incident briefing cadence, restructured moderation pipelines with fast escalation paths, set up a community council for co-reviewing product updates, and rebuilt onboarding to set clear expectations upfront.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="case__col">
              <div class="case__block">
                <span class="label">The outcome</span>
                <div class="case__stats">
                  <div class="case__stat">
                    <span class="case__stat-num">68%</span>
                    <span class="case__stat-label">reduction in negative sentiment posts over 90 days</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="case__stat">
                    <span class="case__stat-num">3×</span>
                    <span class="case__stat-label">improvement in moderator team retention</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="case__stat">
                    <span class="case__stat-num">40%</span>
                    <span class="case__stat-label">increase in actionable product feedback submitted by members</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <!-- Case 2 -->
        <article class="case" aria-labelledby="case-gaming-heading">
          <div class="case__header">
            <div>
              <div class="case__orgs">
                <span class="badge badge--community">Gaming</span>
                <span class="badge badge--ai">Platform Safety</span>
              </div>
              <h2 id="case-gaming-heading">
                Scaling gaming operations, integrity, and bilingual community support
              </h2>
            </div>
            <div class="case__meta">
              <span class="read-time">Asia Pacific &middot; Regional Live Operations</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="case__body">
            <div class="case__col">
              <div class="case__block">
                <span class="label">The challenge</span>
                <p>A major multiplayer gaming platform saw player growth outpace its moderation capabilities. Ticket backlogs stretched past 14 days, in-game toxicity degraded retention, and moderation staff relied on ad-hoc, reactive bans without clear guidelines.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="case__block">
                <span class="label">The approach</span>
                <p>Built a tiered moderation system: automated filters for high-volume spam and hate speech, a vetted volunteer moderator program for in-game lobbies, and a specialist safety team handling serious violations. Documented a full operating manual, established fair appeals, and launched a metrics dashboard.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="case__col">
              <div class="case__block">
                <span class="label">The outcome</span>
                <div class="case__stats">
                  <div class="case__stat">
                    <span class="case__stat-num">14d→2d</span>
                    <span class="case__stat-label">average ticket turnaround time</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="case__stat">
                    <span class="case__stat-num">52%</span>
                    <span class="case__stat-label">drop in repeat policy violations within 30 days</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="case__stat">
                    <span class="case__stat-num">200+</span>
                    <span class="case__stat-label">volunteer moderators trained and active</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <!-- Case 3 -->
        <article class="case" aria-labelledby="case-trust-heading">
          <div class="case__header">
            <div>
              <div class="case__orgs">
                <span class="badge badge--ai">AI Governance</span>
                <span class="badge badge--community">Applied AI Operations</span>
              </div>
              <h2 id="case-trust-heading">
                End-to-end AI governance for an AI-generated community podcast
              </h2>
            </div>
            <div class="case__meta">
              <span class="read-time">Global Exchange &middot; Production AI Pipeline</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="case__body">
            <div class="case__col">
              <div class="case__block">
                <span class="label">The challenge</span>
                <p>Converting high-volume community FAQs into engaging audio content across global regions without incurring standard podcast studio production costs or exposing the organization to legal, regulatory, or brand hallucination risks.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="case__block">
                <span class="label">The approach</span>
                <p>Conceived and produced an AI-generated Spotify podcast series (3 themed seasons of 10 episodes). Independently built an end-to-end AI governance practice: cross-functional sign-off protocols across legal, compliance, marketing, and finance; clear public AI disclosure; and script-to-audio QA controls closely mapping to the NIST AI Risk Management Framework.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="case__col">
              <div class="case__block">
                <span class="label">The outcome</span>
                <div class="case__stats">
                  <div class="case__stat">
                    <span class="case__stat-num">&lt;$5</span>
                    <span class="case__stat-label">production cost per episode using AI voice generation and automated scripting</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="case__stat">
                    <span class="case__stat-num">30</span>
                    <span class="case__stat-label">fully produced and audited episodes across 3 themed educational seasons</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="case__stat">
                    <span class="case__stat-num">100%</span>
                    <span class="case__stat-label">compliance sign-off across legal, risk, and marketing with zero hallucination incidents</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- REQUEST CTA -->
    <section class="portfolio-cta section--sm" aria-labelledby="portfolio-cta-heading">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="card card--featured portfolio-cta__card">
          <h2 id="portfolio-cta-heading">Need more operational detail?</h2>
          <p>Detailed reviews with specific methodologies, metrics, and incident playbooks are available for prospective clients and partners.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary" id="portfolio-contact-cta">Request case study details →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
/* CASE STUDIES */
.case { padding-block: var(--space-8); }
.case__header {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: var(--space-6);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
}
.case__orgs { display: flex; gap: var(--space-2); flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }
.case__header h2 { font-size: clamp(1.375rem, 2.5vw, 2rem); max-width: 600px; }
.case__meta { flex-shrink: 0; padding-top: var(--space-2); }

.case__body { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: var(--space-10); }
.case__col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-6); }
.case__block .label { display: block; margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
.case__block p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.7; }

.case__stats { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-5); margin-top: var(--space-4); }
.case__stat {
  background: var(--bg-elevated);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-6);
}
.case__stat-num {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 2rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--terracotta);
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  line-height: 1.1;
  margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
}
.case__stat-label { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5; }

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .case__header { flex-direction: column; }
  .case__body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--space-6); }
}

.portfolio-cta__card { padding: var(--space-10); text-align: center; }
.portfolio-cta__card h2 { margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }
.portfolio-cta__card > p { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-8); max-width: 440px; margin-inline: auto; margin-bottom: var(--space-8); }
</style>
